"fum_370_iq6_AAAAAB","label":"純陀〔楊侃嗣子〕","status":"ai_provisional","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"純陀","mention_ids":["c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p014:m0152"]}],"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-weishu-weishou","book_id":"b-weishu-weishou-058","source_id":"s-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-ws2087998","chapter_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan","paragraph_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p014","mention_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p014:m0152","quote":"純陀"}],"identity_note":"侃傳末子純陀襲，明子與襲分開，不由繼爵單獨推父子。","family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"parent_person_id":"fum_370_iq6_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-weishu-weishou","book_id":"b-weishu-weishou-058","source_id":"s-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-ws2087998","chapter_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan","paragraph_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p014","quote":"莊帝將圖尒朱榮也，侃與其內弟李晞、城陽王徽、侍中李彧等，咸預密謀。尒朱兆之入洛也，侃時休沐，遂得潛竄，歸於華陰。普泰初，天光在關西，遣侃子婦父韋義遠招慰之，立盟許恕其罪。侃從兄昱恐為家禍，令侃出應，假其食言，不過一人身歿，冀全百口。侃往赴之，秋七月，為天光所害。太昌初，贈車騎將軍、儀同三司、幽州刺史。子純陀襲。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p014:m0152","object_person_mention_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p014:m0009","source_term":"子純陀襲"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-weishu058-yang-013","interpretation_note":"僅明近系直接父親，ID後綴非排行；未知婚配不補。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）"}}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-ws2087998","work_id":"w-weishu-weishou","book_id":"b-weishu-weishou-058","chapter_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan","raw_mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p014:m0152"],"paragraph_ids":["c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p014"],"table_cell_ids":[],"occurrence_groups":[{"canonical_mention_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p014:m0152","mention_ids":["c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p014:m0152"],"kind":"paragraph"}],"mention_count":1,"duplicate_mention_count":0,"p