bo-yangkan","paragraph_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p005","quote":"景明初，兼侍中，使恒州，贍恤寒乏。轉左衞將軍。出除安北將軍、并州刺史，固辭，乃授安西將軍、華州刺史。至州借民田，為御史王基所劾，削除官爵。延昌二年，卒于家。子侃等停柩不葬，披訴積年，至熙平中乃贈鎮西將軍、雍州刺史，并復其爵，諡曰壯。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p005:m0079","object_person_mention_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p005:m0109"}},{"assertion_id":"a-weishu058-yang-013","from_person_id":"fum_370_iq6_AAAAA","to_person_id":"fum_370_iq6_AAAAAB","traversal":"father_to_child","source_term":"子純陀襲","evidence":{"work_id":"w-weishu-weishou","book_id":"b-weishu-weishou-058","source_id":"s-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-ws2087998","chapter_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan","paragraph_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p014","quote":"莊帝將圖尒朱榮也，侃與其內弟李晞、城陽王徽、侍中李彧等，咸預密謀。尒朱兆之入洛也，侃時休沐，遂得潛竄，歸於華陰。普泰初，天光在關西，遣侃子婦父韋義遠招慰之，立盟許恕其罪。侃從兄昱恐為家禍，令侃出應，假其食言，不過一人身歿，冀全百口。侃往赴之，秋七月，為天光所害。太昌初，贈車騎將軍、儀同三司、幽州刺史。子純陀襲。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p014:m0152","object_person_mention_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p014:m0009"}}]},"work_id":"w-weishu-weishou","book_id":"b-weishu-weishou-058","source_id":"s-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-ws2087998"}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p014:m0152","start":152,"end":154,"surface":"純陀","kind":"person","person_id":"fum_370_iq6_AAAAAB","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"侃傳末子純陀襲，明子與襲分開，不由繼爵單獨推父子。","paragraph_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p014","chapter_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan"}],"relations":[{"id":"a-weishu058-yang-013","subject_person_id":"fum_370_iq6_AAAAAB","predicate":"father","object_person_id":"fum_370_iq6_AAAAA","status":"source_attested","qualifiers":{"source_term":"子純陀襲"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-weishu-weishou","book_id":"b-weishu-weishou-058","source_id":"s-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-ws2087998","chapter_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan","paragraph_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p014","quote":"莊帝將圖尒朱榮也，侃與